OL,3,ABurnham tells young people EU deal 'is
OL,4,Afor you' as Badenoch criticises it as
OL,5,Aunfair
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK and EU agree a new deal covering
OL,8,Ffood exports, youth mobility and carbon
OL,9,Femissions - but talks on student
OL,10,Ftuition fees will continue
OL,12,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham calls it a
OL,13,F"historic moment", saying people in the
OL,14,FUK want a "better deal" with the EU
OL,15,Fthan the "hard Brexit we ended up
OL,16,Fwith"; President of the European
OL,17,FCommission Ursula von der Leyen says
OL,18,Fit's a "big success"
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
