OL,3,ABurnham tells young people EU deal 'is
OL,4,Afor you' as Badenoch criticises it as
OL,5,Aunfair
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut Conservative leader Kemi Badenoch
OL,8,Fsays the deal "isn't fair" and doesn't
OL,9,Fdeal with the problems the UK faces.
OL,10,FReform UK's Nigel Farage says the deal
OL,11,Fcontradicts Labour manifesto and
OL,12,Frepresents a "very good day for the EU"
OL,14,FIt comes after the EU demanded the UK
OL,15,Fagree to cut university tuition fees
OL,16,Ffor European students, with Britain
OL,17,Fgiven six months to agree or negotiate
OL,18,Fan alternative
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
